# WAIA — project overview

WAIA = "Open AI infrastructure for humans, businesses and society."

## Tech stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 16 App Router, Turbopack, RSC by default
- **Language**: TypeScript (strict)
- **UI**: Tailwind CSS v4, shadcn/ui (`components/ui/`), Lucide icons
- **State / animation** (when needed): React 19 hooks, framer-motion (if added)
- **Package manager**: pnpm (with `node-linker=hoisted` — required by Tailwind v4 + shadcn)
- **Testing**: Vitest + @testing-library/react (unit, `tests/unit/`), Playwright (e2e, `tests/e2e/`)
- **Lint / format**: ESLint 9 flat config, Prettier
- **Deploy**: Cloudflare Pages from `main` (manual `dev` -> `main` merge by the user)

## Repo layout

- `app/` — Next.js routes
- `components/` — shared React components, `components/ui/` for shadcn primitives
- `lib/` — pure utilities (`lib/utils.ts` exports `cn()`)
- `tests/unit/`, `tests/e2e/` — tests
- `docs/` — human-readable documentation
- `.cursor/` — agent rules, hooks, commands, MCP (committed)
- `.github/` — CI, PR/issue templates, CODEOWNERS

